# Ares Vallis: all dirt, dug into the plain. A wide right sweeper and an S onto the whoops,
# a U-berm, an S climbing to a jump that lands in a descent, a long left sweeper down the west
# side, a berm and two S-bends at the bottom, then up the middle over more whoops to the finish.
# A test bench for the dirt corridors: wide floors to drift on, no road, no crossing.
name Ares Vallis
seed 2026
start 0 0 0 0 dirt
straight2 dirt
turn3_right dirt
straight dirt
turn2_left dirt
whoops3 dirt
checkpoint dirt
uberm2_left dirt
straight dirt
turn2_right dirt
slope3_up1 dirt
jump_ramp dirt
landing5_down1 dirt
turn3_left dirt
straight dirt
checkpoint dirt
berm2_left dirt
turn2_right dirt
turn2_left dirt
straight dirt
turn2_left dirt
whoops2 dirt
checkpoint dirt
straight2 dirt
finish dirt

# The colony's scenery (crates/track/src/camp.rs): a base camp beside the start, a field camp in
# the loop, a post over the jump, a mast to the east, two caches along the dirt, and the landing
# zone with its mine to the north.
structure base_camp -90 60 90
structure field_camp 80 170 0
structure post 170 330 0
structure mast 480 330 0
structure cache -200 330 90
structure cache 300 160 -90
structure landing_zone -20 540 0
